🌙 LastNight SaaS (SERVE AS A SERVICE.)

AI-powered exam survival platform built for GLOBAL college students.

LastNight helps students prepare smarter during exam season by transforming study material into concise notes, important questions, MCQs, flashcards, viva questions, revision sheets, and exam-night summaries.
🚀 Features

- 📚 Theory Notes
- ❓ Important Questions
- 📝 MCQ Generation
- 🎤 Viva Questions
- ⚡ Revision Sheets
- 🧠 Flashcards
- 📖 Previous Year Question (PYQ) Focused Preparation
- 🌙 Exam-Night Summaries
- 🤖 AI Tutor
- 📊 Quiz Attempts & Performance Tracking

🎯 Problem

College students often struggle with lengthy notes and lack enough time before exams. LastNight simplifies preparation by providing structured, high-impact study material that helps students revise efficiently and score better.

💡 Solution

Upload study resources and get:

- Concise theory notes
- Important exam questions
- AI-generated MCQs
- Viva questions
- Revision sheets
- Flashcards
- PYQ-based preparation
- Last-minute exam summaries

🛠 Tech Stack

Frontend
- Next.js
- React.js
- Tailwind CSS

Backend
- Node.js

Database
- Supabase

Authentication
- Supabase Auth

Deployment
- Vercel

Payments
- Razorpay

